{"id":"n16730-1-6","stage":3,"title":"쓸데없다 · 没用","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16730-1-6-1","ko":"누나가 드라마 본다고 해서 내가 야구 경기를 못 봤어요!","zh":"因为姐姐说要看电视剧，所以我才没能看到棒球比赛啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누나가","meaning":"姐姐","explanation":"누나：姐姐；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누나","audio":"/audio/6f46257ffa57c2f085e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32205","senseId":"1","lemma":"누나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드라마","meaning":"电视剧，连续剧","explanation":"드라마：电视剧，连续剧","readings":[{"term":"드라마","audio":"/audio/48196dde09d3559f1d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61389","senseId":"1","lemma":"드라마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"본다고","meaning":"表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。","explanation":"보다：表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해서","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"야구","meaning":"棒球","explanation":"야구：棒球","readings":[{"term":"야구","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62512","senseId":"1","lemma":"야구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경기를","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어요!","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f46257ffa57c2f0","term":"누나","zh":"姐姐","audio":"/audio/6f46257ffa57c2f085e4.mp3","entryId":"32205","definition":"男子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["누ː나"]},{"id":"48196dde09d3559f","term":"드라마","zh":"电视剧，连续剧","audio":"/audio/48196dde09d3559f1d2b.mp3","entryId":"61389","definition":"在影院上映或电视上播放的剧。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。；看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"表示有意去做前面的话语所指的行动。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"7403c43735a4108c","term":"야구","zh":"棒球","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3","entryId":"62512","definition":"各由九名队员组成的两队轮流攻守，用棍子击打对方选手投出的球并绕竞技场一周即可得分的比赛。","pronunciation":["야ː구"]},{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"60094","definition":"互相比较运动或技术等的能力。","pronunciation":["경ː기"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/50b621580c22ff7f3ef0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16730-1-6-2","ko":"그렇게 쓸데없는 일로 싸우지 좀 말아라.","zh":"别为那种没意义的事情吵架了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓸데없는","meaning":"没用，无用","explanation":"쓸데없다：没用，无用；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쓸데없다","audio":"/audio/eedc7c205d702220eee4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16730","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓸데없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일로","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸우지","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말아라.","meaning":"不做","explanation":"말다：不做；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"eedc7c205d702220","term":"쓸데없다","zh":"没用，无用","audio":"/audio/eedc7c205d702220eee4.mp3","entryId":"16730","definition":"没有任何利益或用处。","pronunciation":["쓸떼업따"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"想要获胜而用语言或力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸우다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不做","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不做某事；或指不是。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/978a58b8dc01c3dabed7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.179,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16730","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":119,"sequenceScore":3.4824,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为姐姐说要看电视剧，所以我才没能看到棒球比赛啊！","别为那种没意义的事情吵架了。","成绩有提升一点吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为姐姐说要看电视剧，所以我才没能看到棒球比赛啊！","别为那种没意义的事情吵架了。","成绩有提升一点吗？"],"answer":1}]}
